// @name: 01 — Strudel solo
// @tagline: single actor, zero regression vs strudel.cc
// @description: One self-contained `.bps`: an actor whose Strudel code voice is inlined as a backtick and transported to audio. Put the cursor in the session and Ctrl+Enter to evaluate; Ctrl+. to hush.
// @language: strudel
// @outputs: audio
// @level: didactic
// @tags: drums_r, strudel
// @showcase
//
// 01 — Strudel solo (migré de 01-strudel-solo.kanopi).
// Une voix de code : Strudel (eval) → sortie audio (transport).
// Évaluer la voix `drums_r`, puis couper.

core

actor drums  eval.strudel

-----
S -> drums_r

drums_r -> drums.`note("c3 e3 g3 c4").s("sine").gain(0.7)`
